# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout.
#
# Golden analyses and knowledge records are compared byte for byte against
# canonically serialized JSON, which uses LF. Without this, a Windows checkout
# rewrites them to CRLF and the comparison fails for a reason that has nothing
# to do with the analysis. Lua and Rust sources are equally happier with one
# line ending everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# PowerShell is the one exception: some older hosts are unhappy with LF-only
# scripts, and .editorconfig already declares CRLF for them.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Never touch binary content.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
